{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 68,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To the chief Musician, A Psalm ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "or",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Song of David. Let God arise, let his enemies be scattered: let them also that hate him flee before him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As smoke is driven away, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " drive ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " away: as wax melteth before the fire, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "so",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " let the wicked perish at the presence of God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But let the righteous be glad; let them rejoice before God: yes, let them exceedingly rejoice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sing to God, sing praises to his name: extol him that rideth upon the heavens by his name JAH, and rejoice before him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A father of the fatherless, and a judge of the widows, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God in his holy habitation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "God setteth the solitary in families: he bringeth out those who are bound with chains: but the rebellious dwell in a dry ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "land",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O God, when thou wentest forth before thy people, when thou didst march through the wilderness; Selah:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The earth shook, the heavens also dropped at the presence of God: ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Sinai itself ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was moved",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " at the presence of God, the God of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou, O God, didst send a plentiful rain, by which thou didst confirm thy inheritance, when it was weary.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy congregation hath dwelt therein: thou, O God, hast prepared of thy goodness for the poor.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD gave the word: great ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the company of those that published ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Kings of armies fled apace: and she that tarried at home divided the spoil.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Though ye have lain among the pots, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "yet shall ye be as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the wings of a dove covered with silver, and her feathers with yellow gold.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "When the Almighty scattered kings in it, it was ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "white",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " as snow in Salmon.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The hill of God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the hill of Bashan; a high hill ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the hill of Bashan.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Why leap ye, ye lofty hills? ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "this is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the hill ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God desireth to dwell in; yes, the LORD will dwell ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "in it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The chariots of God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " twenty thousand, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " thousands of angels: the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " among them, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "as in",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Sinai, in the holy ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "place",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou hast ascended on high, thou hast led captivity captive: thou hast received gifts for men; yes, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "for",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the rebellious also, that the LORD God might dwell ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "among them",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "who",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " daily loadeth us ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "with benefits",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the God of our salvation. Selah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He that is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " our God ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the God of salvation; and to God the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "belong",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the issues from death.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But God will wound the head of his enemies, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the hairy scalp of such one as goeth on still in his trespasses.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD said, I will bring again from Bashan, I will bring ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "my people",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " again from the depths of the sea.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That thy foot may be dipped in the blood of thy enemies, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the tongue of thy dogs in the same.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They have seen thy goings, O God; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the goings of my God, my King, in the sanctuary.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The singers went before, the players on instruments ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "followed",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " after; among ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "them were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the damsels playing with timbrels.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Bless ye God in the congregations, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD, from the fountain of Israel.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "There ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " little Benjamin ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "with",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their ruler, the princes of Judah ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " their counsel, the princes of Zebulun, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the princes of Naphtali.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thy God hath commanded thy strength: strengthen, O God, that which thou hast wrought for us.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Because of thy temple at Jerusalem shall kings bring presents to thee.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Rebuke the company of spearmen, the multitude of the bulls, with the calves of the people, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "till every one shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " submit himself with pieces of silver: scatter thou the people ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " delight in war.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Princes shall come out of Egypt; Cush shall soon stretch out her hands to God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Sing to God, ye kingdoms of the earth; O sing praises ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the LORD; Selah:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "To him that rideth upon the heavens of heavens, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "which were",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of old; lo, he doth send out his voice, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " a mighty voice.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ascribe ye strength to God: his excellence ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " over Israel, and his strength ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the clouds.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.68.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.68.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O God, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thou art",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " terrible out of thy holy places: the God of Israel ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " he that giveth strength and power to ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " people. Blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
